window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Katt’s parents taught her how to hide her magic. Her whole life she’s never met another witch. She read that in the past there were enough that they worked together, but she’s never witnessed this. Entering college, she discovers there are not only other witches, but also a coven; her mind is blown. And then she learns about werewolves.</p> <p>Jett moves to Santa Cruz after being accepted into the local University. With her dorms backing up to the woods, her full moon night runs will be a breeze. She thought running into a witch on campus is bad, but learning there’s a local pack is a lot worse. When a classmate dies from unusual circumstances, she wonders if she made the right decision moving to the coast.</p>"; 
